async Discover(){const mode=window.dm||"trending",q=window._dq||"",kind=window.dk||"";const d=await api(`discover?mode=${mode}&q=${encodeURIComponent(q)}&kind=${kind}`);const st=d.status;
return `<div class="card"><div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center">${[["trending","🔥 Hot / trending"],["popular","🏆 All-time popular"]].map(([m,l])=>`<button class="${m==mode?"pri":""}" onclick="dm='${m}';render()">${l}</button>`).join("")}
<input id="dq" value="${E(q)}" placeholder="search skills…" onkeydown="if(event.key=='Enter'){window._dq=this.value;render()}"> <select onchange="dk=this.value;render()">${["","skill","plugin","rules","agents_md","list"].map(k=>`<option ${k==kind?"selected":""} value="${k}">${k||"all kinds"}</option>`).join("")}</select>
<span class="spacer"></span><span class="mut">${st.entries} entries · last scan ${E(st.last_run?st.last_run.ts:"never")} · token ${st.token_ref?`<code>${E(st.token_ref)}</code>`:'<span class="pill pending">none</span>'}</span> <button onclick="post('discover/run',{})">scan GitHub now</button></div></div>
<div class="card">${d.rows.length?(()=>{const gs=[],gi={};d.rows.forEach(r=>{const k=r.id.split(":")[0];if(!(k in gi)){gi[k]=gs.length;gs.push({repo:k,h:r,items:[],seen:{}})}const g=gs[gi[k]],sk=r.name+"|"+r.kind,j=g.seen[sk];if(j===undefined){g.seen[sk]=g.items.length;g.items.push(r)}else if(r.imported_skill&&!g.items[j].imported_skill)g.items[j]=r});
const act=r=>r.imported_skill?pill(r.status):r.path?`<button class="pri" onclick="post('discover/add',{id:${J(r.id)},allow_license:${!r.license_ok}&&confirm(${J('License '+(r.license||'')+' is not on the allow-list. Import anyway after checking terms?')})})">Add</button>`:'<span class="mut">repo/list</span>';
return `<p class="mut sm">${gs.length} repos · ${gs.reduce((a,g)=>a+g.items.length,0)} distinct skills, rules and agent files</p><table><tr><th>repo and what it offers</th><th>★</th><th>Δ 1d / 7d</th><th>forks</th><th>license</th><th>updated</th></tr>${gs.slice(0,60).map(g=>{const r=g.h;return `<tr><td><b>${E(g.repo)}</b> <a href="https://github.com/${E(g.repo)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="mut">↗</a><div class="mut">${E(r.description.slice(0,140))}</div><div class="skl">${g.items.map(x=>`<span class="sk"><a href="${E(x.url)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b>${E(x.name)}</b></a> ${pill(x.kind)} ${act(x)}</span>`).join("")}</div></td><td><b>${r.stars}</b></td><td>${r.delta_1d>0?`<span class="done">+${r.delta_1d}</span>`:"0"} / ${r.delta_7d>0?`<span class="done">+${r.delta_7d}</span>`:"0"}</td><td>${r.forks}</td><td>${r.license_ok?pill("ok")+" "+E(r.license):`<span class="pill pending" title="not on allow-list">${E(r.license)}</span>`}</td><td class="mut">${r.days_since_push<9999?r.days_since_push+"d ago":""}</td></tr>`}).join("")}</table>`})():empty("🔭","No discovered skills yet","<div>Configure a token ref (<code>commons skills configure --token-ref env://GITHUB_TOKEN</code>) and click <b>scan GitHub now</b>. The scheduler refreshes daily.</div>")}</div>
<div class="card mut">Imports are pinned to a commit, run through the review gate (license allow-list, secret + prompt-injection scan) and never auto-activate. Upstream changes arrive as new pending versions with diffs.</div>`},
